      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a rough current though. it's the reality. i look at the numbers and it's literally impossible. it's like being trapped in a room with no doors and everyone is just watching me struggle. everything i do to fix it just makes it worse. i just want the noise to stop. i just want it all to be over.",
