      "content": "you keep saying it's just a dark room or a wall, but it feels like the only real solution is to just... stop. like, if i wasn't here, the debt wouldn't matter. my family wouldn't have to deal with my failures. it's almost like the only way to actually solve the problem is to exit the equation entirely. it feels so logical when i think about it that way.",
